            <ArticleTitle>Monitored anesthesia care for laparoscopies in oncology patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>43-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A retrospective chart review was conducted on 241 oncology patients who received monitored anesthesia care for laparoscopy. A review of perioperative analgesic and sedative requirements, and perioperative complications is included. The authors conclude that laparoscopy for diagnostic and staging purposes can be accomplished successfully with monitored anesthesia care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
